OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK's 'dismal' Eurovision song choices
OL,4,Ato be examined by MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of the Digital, Culture,
OL,7,FMedia and Sport committee, Dame
OL,8,FCaroline Dinenage, said: "We want to
OL,9,Fget to the bottom of who chooses our
OL,10,Fentrant, on what basis and whether our
OL,11,Fdismal record of achievement in recent
OL,12,Fyears [Sam Ryder to one side] is the
OL,13,Fresult of bad song choice, weak
OL,14,Fperformance... or something else".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
